    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/ddc5b2752c35814b9bb23cb6fe57fea0.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><strong>In the eerie town of Ashfort, a well-respected exorcist named Salazar embarked on a daunting task assigned by the Aureate Order. However, his zeal was met with a grim fate as his exorcism ritual turned disastrous, forcing him to make a desperate escape. <br>Alas, Salazar's valiant attempt to flee the scene proved futile, and he perished within the very house he sought to purify. Unbeknown to senior exorcist Salazar's fate, the Aureate Order dispatched a novice exorcist to investigate.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/fb6fb21735039e7d6ec496ad56b1cf95.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/698fb467fbad8ed96beed3a888e4a0ce.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/698fb467fbad8ed96beed3a888e4a0ce.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/698fb467fbad8ed96beed3a888e4a0ce.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Through the use of Unreal Engine 5, photorealistic graphics can be attained without significant performance loss. This way, you can better immerse yourself in your surroundings and atmosphere.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/491972d125a013a803582cb1e7a49549.webp?t=1705073862\" width=200 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/72e41aea52d7daec7b5acce5e2dd8067.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/72e41aea52d7daec7b5acce5e2dd8067.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/72e41aea52d7daec7b5acce5e2dd8067.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Investigate abandoned places using a variety of distinctive tools. Uncover hidden secrets and unravel the truth behind Salazar's disappearance. Report your findings to the Aurete Order, a secret society of exorcists.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/6974ed50a726933df1d4fd04f8c98505.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/baf7ddb6b0830c05cda088d510f56637.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/baf7ddb6b0830c05cda088d510f56637.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/baf7ddb6b0830c05cda088d510f56637.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Explore haunted locations, utilizing various objects to redirect the entity's attention. This strategic approach works both ways, as the monster is also capable of interacting with its environment to influence the player's progress.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/0898c71a49387f321349aa8980cef949.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/53a0cfa29a273321b4a0ddb403f7c8d8.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/53a0cfa29a273321b4a0ddb403f7c8d8.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/53a0cfa29a273321b4a0ddb403f7c8d8.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Preserving your sanity is paramount in this haunted environment. While remaining in the light keeps your mental fortitude high , prolonged exposure could draw the entity's attention. Stay vigilant and tread carefully, as the balance between survival and peril is a delicate one.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/43a76c6c2d897cef5660d3d299b5a2f3.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/bf44e68ec92cf4f7c70177739d3ed37f.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/bf44e68ec92cf4f7c70177739d3ed37f.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/bf44e68ec92cf4f7c70177739d3ed37f.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Upon successfully completing your assigned tasks or even abandoning your mission midway, you can attempt to leave the haunted location. Return to the Aurete Order, heeding the summons of your superiors, to share your findings and elevate your standing within the order.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/ddc5b2752c35814b9bb23cb6fe57fea0.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><strong>In the eerie town of Ashfort, a well-respected exorcist named Salazar embarked on a daunting task assigned by the Aureate Order. However, his zeal was met with a grim fate as his exorcism ritual turned disastrous, forcing him to make a desperate escape. <br>Alas, Salazar's valiant attempt to flee the scene proved futile, and he perished within the very house he sought to purify. Unbeknown to senior exorcist Salazar's fate, the Aureate Order dispatched a novice exorcist to investigate.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/fb6fb21735039e7d6ec496ad56b1cf95.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/698fb467fbad8ed96beed3a888e4a0ce.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/698fb467fbad8ed96beed3a888e4a0ce.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/698fb467fbad8ed96beed3a888e4a0ce.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Through the use of Unreal Engine 5, photorealistic graphics can be attained without significant performance loss. This way, you can better immerse yourself in your surroundings and atmosphere.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/491972d125a013a803582cb1e7a49549.webp?t=