rong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/0898c71a49387f321349aa8980cef949.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/53a0cfa29a273321b4a0ddb403f7c8d8.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/53a0cfa29a273321b4a0ddb403f7c8d8.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/53a0cfa29a273321b4a0ddb403f7c8d8.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Preserving your sanity is paramount in this haunted environment. While remaining in the light keeps your mental fortitude high , prolonged exposure could draw the entity's attention. Stay vigilant and tread carefully, as the balance between survival and peril is a delicate one.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/43a76c6c2d897cef5660d3d299b5a2f3.webp?t=1705073862\" width=300 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/bf44e68ec92cf4f7c70177739d3ed37f.poster.avif?t=1705073862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/bf44e68ec92cf4f7c70177739d3ed37f.webm?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768350/extras/bf44e68ec92cf4f7c70177739d3ed37f.mp4?t=1705073862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s